                  <nc xml:id="m-16cb956d-e2cd-4667-a6a3-3f9871044461" pname="d" oct="3"><quilisma /></nc><nc xml:id="m-5d130463-78cf-4c40-b8be-f786219b95e5" pname="e" oct="3" /><nc xml:id="m-63d7ce42-c776-46ec-9ad3-fca8ec829fe3" pname="f" oct="3" /><nc xml:id="m-fabab797-efb6-4a52-86cf-ad079561a5a4" pname="d" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><divLine xml:id="m-7308f6b0-e26a-4adb-8551-19549b4d6a6e" facs="#m-56eb2783-83ea-460f-b698-0e881cb16724" form="finalis" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-b39409ff-0829-4c1b-865d-c50c8e33d3ae"><lg xml:id="m-641fe6be-9d18-4252-a757-1948cbc15ad3"><l xml:id="m-ebf35f50-23ab-466c-8ee2-3b41868c5a68" facs="#m-ae33918f-6356-43f3-b9c4-adaec18befa1" label="ambiguous">1490</l><l xml:id="m-b3863b35-5001-4d08-aeac-7885f0e6cafb" facs="#m-2c193597-d1eb-4138-a28f-33415ded67d5" label="ambiguous">Iune 15. 17.</l><l xml:id="m-577f6953-8e25-41c1-aabe-e93db3ccfe66" facs="#m-3be8a5d4-e496-4050-923f-a8b020b8a777" label="ambiguous">ni</l><l xml:id="m-dc5629ea-9b8d-4d3b-8508-f7bb6fb69c51" facs="#m-969dd573-9db3-4c50-9565-b85378f6fb9f" label="lyrics-like">Dá¬</l><l xml:id="m-2eea751d-497e-431c-b022-a2893971e6b1" facs="#m-4fef4a0c-feeb-45f1-98ae-e8491fec2e30" label="ambiguous">vid</l><l xml:id="m-c1892975-3126-4fd4-8220-9992b39f5801" facs="#m-c099c2bf-48a7-4f9a-bd76-f24a83eb92e4" label="lyrics-like">sér¬</l><l xml:id="m-6d78f453-91cd-4cc4-a336-85a3f2464c03" facs="#m-c4e694b0-c802-41e9-b437-bc3bd26da5ac" label="lyrics-like">sáncto mé¬</l><l xml:id="m-71b8bf04-28a8-4d08-9abf-230df0dd4b27" facs="#m-1475ea20-aa09-492d-9b24-0def23b06786" label="lyrics-like">vum mé¬ um : 6- le¬</l><l xml:id="m-c240d409-0ff6-485e-a401-a343bbbca368" facs="#m-3934ca43-f26c-46dc-85f1-3ba72b165111" label="ambiguous">o</l><l xml:id="m-4ba10ae6-4d78-4387-83b6-8adfafd4e01c" facs="#m-83dc3530-567b-40a4-a4b7-a115435c9e49" label="lyrics-like">únxi " é¬</l><l xml:id="m-4211121e-410d-4d78-bebe-9869fb2b6788" facs="#m-d8708a1c-4021-43d2-aefc-e075d4eac933" label="ambiguous">um.</l><l xml:id="m-0b799a44-87b9-4d21-817a-969acff100e2" facs="#m-1db20db9-c8a3-4815-8a25-dcba729d1716" label="ambiguous">o</l><l xml:id="m-9e790b5b-9d8b-4840-96f2-9ffcfe34c24b" facs="#m-2a444a74-8323-4974-adfb-b5ecfaf1d700" label="text-like">Gospel. Si quis venit. D. 113t. Then add:</l><l xml:id="m-a43d0bb5-1ebf-428a-ac36-183cae4c8d71" facs="#m-6ff9acfc-fd6a-4d15-9972-84cf2b1c4967" label="lyrics-like">Bonum est sal. Si autem sal eva- útile est, sed foras mittétur. Qui</l><l xml:id="m-8c463767-8016-4b61-a9ab-47590f117d66" facs="#m-49fffee4-eee5-40e8-a183-eaf09a2adecb" label="lyrics-like">núerit, in quo condiétur? Neque! habet aures audiéndi, áudiat.</l><l xml:id="m-1b09ba6a-d12a-4b3f-9de5-ec79e6ef2cd7" facs="#m-595daadd-1998-4b64-804d-5e80b62fe36f" label="ambiguous">Credo.</l><l xml:id="m-a38649fc-3c0d-46e4-b7ba-3b55d996be66" facs="#m-a33b6d1f-c36b-44af-802b-3f36670725ba" label="ambiguous">in terram, neque in sterquilinium</l><l xml:id="m-f7fad18f-8f34-4412-ba8b-65bcac09ff0f" facs="#m-006b1a82-3c38-4f6c-a55f-4c7c4b897c49" label="lyrics-like">Offertory. Véritas méa. D. 1203. — Secret. Sancti Basilii. p. 1188.</l><l xml:id="m-b6824a22-0d98-4be2-92cd-84f13e5c0e87" facs="#m-cd4ecea0-cf82-4f14-8c46-773a5b8de9fb" label="lyrics-like">Commanton. Fidélis sérvus p. 1185.— Postcom. Déus, fidélium. p. 1188.</l><l xml:id="m-779d0045-cf65-4820-a029-8ffd72c4fb3f" facs="#m-c787c04a-e916-49d0-ae57-34f6e83fc8df" label="text-like">15. SS. Vitus, Modestus, and Crescentia, Martyrs. Simple.</l><l xml:id="m-df9b9aa5-8f55-42f5-96a8-3a86666679b6" facs="#m-3b41a12b-d9e3-4a42-b3ed-71bbcc04451c" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-1daa641a-b4f4-4d6b-acad-a7c4468a0143" facs="#m-c81139de-e3fb-47bb-9633-470fcc3f984c" label="lyrics-like">A Ecclésiae tuae, quaésumus sed tibi plácita humilitáte profi¬</l><l xml:id="m-599b2bad-064d-4f6d-a3ae-7205d195af35" facs="#m-553dfe5f-456f-43cb-9b93-3e42f51d93f1" label="lyrics-like">1) Dómine, sanctis Martyribus tuis cere: tut prava despiciens, “quae¬</l><l xml:id="m-0a9dc3ae-b578-4c43-b9a8-20d7e4348b91" facs="#m-cbb60296-d1b0-4497-b5b3-0315bfaeb2ba" label="lyrics-like">Vito, Modésto atque Crescéntia in-cúmque recta sunt, libera exérceat</l><l xml:id="m-9352b4a3-ed37-4eec-a4f1-204cbf1d27d9" facs="#m-64622c25-b44a-4b0a-a774-d3401a87de84" label="lyrics-like">tercedéntibus, supérbe non sápere, caritâte. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-b1c2543c-40b3-4937-9702-851424c34b37" facs="#m-cd6afc2a-5efa-467d-b674-8f4292b7a9df" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-6b50e213-b069-4243-97a4-7aec37badc8f" facs="#m-4be3ffb6-fe79-49a3-873b-03635397fe7a" label="lyrics-like">(icut glóriam divinae poténtiae ne, tuae salvatiónis impéndant. Per</l><l xml:id="m-f26d4da1-8761-4558-bf60-d4f8b8c3e93e" facs="#m-f91a8d3c-9943-4a09-b2a9-c69140e64482" label="lyrics-like">O múnera pro Sanctis obláta te¬</l><l xml:id="m-f36eeff6-183c-4efd-8587-fd47d56327ad" facs="#m-06b88c70-33bd-446b-8ae7-20338ed809f2" label="lyrics-like">Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-5682cb7c-7c7e-44b2-a999-eb47bef7fa66" facs="#m-ea5c202f-801a-40e4-a6a8-b10e862f53ae" label="lyrics-like">stántur : sic nobis efféctum, Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-593a785a-d709-4275-b989-ea46f597cd57" facs="#m-01f8a775-3cdd-46c1-87d7-7751b60d6f16" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-f14acfeb-da8c-4c8e-bae1-46948f44b910" facs="#m-81cf4ecd-46a2-4f0c-8578-5a58c599a0ff" label="lyrics-like">»Epléti, Dómine, benedictióne scéntiae, medicina sacraménti et</l><l xml:id="m-1583e939-b625-4038-8268-c94dc9b8c95b" facs="#m-2f6bd03c-27c3-44fc-b03e-f75103e4cd9e" label="lyrics-like">It solémni: quaésumus; ut per</l><l xml:id="m-c3ae9bfd-004d-4268-8555-cbb8abac06e6" facs="#m-21294b31-cf2e-4695-8311-7e6cf30ea26d" label="lyrics-like">corpóribus nostris prosit et ménti¬</l><l xml:id="m-c3ee0ed4-694e-4b7a-abf8-9f8b5b040e02" facs="#m-ffb668a2-3253-4db9-9df1-4ae34ceeabe6" label="lyrics-like">intercessiónem sanctórum Márty-bus. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-1a9d1ea5-0aa2-455f-b18e-26f9a814d703" facs="#m-bf76fc26-d55b-45d8-9165-d72910a6c6f0" label="lyrics-like">rum tuórum Viti, Modésti et Cre¬</l><l xml:id="m-8d9ad697-e331-470e-af9f-b86a3231ebff" facs="#m-0c735adc-1741-4ddc-9131-2affed8d09c5" label="ambiguous">17.</l><l xml:id="m-cffccf4f-5530-4407-8c6e-de32efbfa9ab" facs="#m-92c5748d-1ecb-4c52-8902-63dd530da68b" label="text-like">St. Gregory Barbarigo, Bishop and Conf.</l><l xml:id="m-05b77334-c154-4bec-8b14-da3ea4b56b20" facs="#m-b7663cd8-d7e7-4d6f-b15e-d36d53a1a3d5" label="ambiguous">I1I class.</l><l xml:id="m-654a75c9-2b2f-42f9-8268-e75498de793b" facs="#m-9b03ff90-fd49-4cd6-8f01-2706d9cc7735" label="lyrics-like">Mass. Státuit. p. 1182, except the Collect.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
